{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2022-12-19 17:04:00', 'title': 'CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS ANNOUNCES ELECTION OF HILLARY A. SALE TO CBOE U.S. SECURITIES EXCHANGES, CFE AND CBOE SEF BOARDS', 'text': 'CHICAGO , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE), A LEADING PROVIDER OF GLOBAL MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE AND TRADABLE PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF HILLARY A. SALE AS A NEW MEMBER OF THE BOARDS OF DIRECTORS FOR THE CBOE U.S. SECURITIES EXCHANGES, CBOE FUTURES EXCHANGE, AND CBOE SEF.'}